{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"31c464ee6b672245e82a3473a258785d74b49d53f330641e62fd3c3bf4a40997","ja":"残された映像","zh":"留下的影像","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"720ea8452495784b014bdb61214f9b2e70aa49ca74349e56be4d02236373a204","ja":"あ、スタッフさんたち、いました～！\nはぐれちゃって、ごめんなさ～いっ！","zh":"啊，找到工作人员们了～！\n跟你们走散了，对不起～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6f2b8618682080b383917a83f54431e79a374182fd02740b819b3a4d311993f7","ja":"「いえいえ。\nすぐ合流できましたし、お気になさらず」","zh":"「哪里哪里。\n马上就汇合了，请别放在心上」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f8ebe524e01a4bb296f035828c61099be59fc36897def3f61e319e596670b12b","ja":"え……？　あ、あの……\n結構時間が経ってたと思うんですけど……？","zh":"诶……？那、那个……\n我觉得已经过了挺长时间了……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3a16db272f4d137f7defe3a6f22caf05b73f35eb7b65853791401efebb306675","ja":"「いえ、数分くらいですよ？　ただ……\nちょっとこれを確認していただきたいんですが……」","zh":"“没有，也就几分钟左右哦？只是……\n想请您确认一下这个……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e703df87ef2381868406f514e736223a9c8ee817ac31da7ea1b3c0685ab64898","ja":"あははっ、たしかに！　逃げろ逃げろ～！\n捕まったらやばいぞ～！","zh":"啊哈哈，确实！快逃快逃～！\n被抓住可就惨啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e3279b06b4ebdfc1a94fba2a7452984ad65ab49682e01f7da15eeed816dede1f","ja":"「これは、皆さんとはぐれる直前の映像で……\nこのあと、なんですけど」","zh":"「这是和大家走散之前的录像……\n而在那之后……」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"525326627a7c9696bb13dcddf7611d9750e1eb56665792f1fdb73b0109b32c08","ja":"えっ……き、消えた……！？","zh":"诶……消、消失了……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"11e317b2c89cb9a40023b4fa0c4f8d781981863b2f494682cc7bb564660c6b35","ja":"ど、ど、ど……\nどうなってるんですか～？","zh":"怎、怎、怎……\n这到底是怎么回事呀～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"1f34ffbcc32ca27a765bfd048530508f0b752c7aa3183064b785976bad67d1e5","ja":"「怖いですよね……その、この映像は没にして、\nもう一度撮り直しても、いいでしょうか……？」","zh":"「很吓人吧……那个，这段录像能不能作废，\n再重新拍一次呢……？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"8a9a55a558f06f6e94ea0554039b5079b05ef79b203651cd38c22729c0de2eef","ja":"あ……は、はい、もちろんです！","zh":"啊……好、好的，当然可以！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"1cb6833f28e2fa1229c3c91ddf4f33f89f153438bb71b71aa3ed8d20b201f66c","ja":"むしろそのほうがウチらもありがたいです……あはは。","zh":"倒不如那样我们还更乐意呢……啊哈哈。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[57].text","source_sha256":"57667837bdae5c3ff728804e7f7fda0f8c53e3d84d7087136679e0f1c8d43033","ja":"なんだよこの映像……。\nアタシら、いったいどこに行ってたんだ！？","zh":"这录像是什么鬼啊……。\n我们到底去哪儿了啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[58].text","source_sha256":"f58454738451ee222cbe05f3ef178fa515541a6145c715596a5bae9206c4314e","ja":"うう、まさかこんなホラーみたいなことに\nなってたなんて……無事に帰ってこれてよかった～！","zh":"呜呜，真没想到竟然会变成\n这种像恐怖片一样的状况……能平安回来真是太好了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[59].text","source_sha256":"82aa4c34b3f47539bce7406631baaedb715fc72fe41d0a246475eeb567a3d12d","ja":"たしかに不気味だけど……でも、ドラマの世界に\n迷い込んだみたいで、ちょっと面白かったかも？","zh":"确实有些诡异……不过，感觉就像\n误入了电视剧的世界一样，好像还挺有趣的？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[69].text","source_sha256":"461ed25ab22448b26b77338f554a70b7993e9ed3791f10d39d001796f1e91a10","ja":"まあ、面白いかどうかはともかく、\nめったにできない経験ではあったな。","zh":"哎，不管有趣与否，\n这确实是难得一见的经历啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[70].text","source_sha256":"861f7d4cb3ae5f0c50dc4dd6352d05ffe5e816f3983a32256e5c736a083ae1c4","ja":"そうね。CMには使えないけど、\n何かで話のネタにできれば、怖さもやわらぐかも。","zh":"也是呢。虽然不能用在广告里，\n但要是能在哪当成聊天的话题，或许恐惧感也会减轻一些。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1746.unity3d","item_key":"commands[71].text","source_sha256":"c83b3922b12bb8f6eefcb983aca78044bb6749bee744f541e82d7439dcd5f4db","ja":"ううう～……私、まだ怖いです～。\n話のネタになんて、ずっとできないかも……。","zh":"呜呜呜～……我、我还是好害怕～。\n可能永远都没法当作笑谈来讲了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
